We now construct polynomials to complete the set  $S$ : \[\begin{aligned} 10x+10 = 0 &\implies x = -1  -x^3 - x + 10 = 0 &\implies x = 2  2x + 10 = 0 &\implies x = -5  -5x^2 - 5x + 10 = 0 &\implies x = 1  x + 2 = 0 &\implies x = -2  x - 5 = 0 &\implies x = 5  x + 10 = 0 &\implies x = -10\end{aligned}\] The answer is  $9$ .</details>

