c+1d\right)  ^{2}+\left(  c+2d\right)  ^{2}+\cdots+\left(  c+nd\right)
^{2}
& =nc^{2}+2c\underbrace{\left(  1+2+\cdots+n\right)  }_{=\dfrac{n\left(
n+1\right)  }{2}}d+\underbrace{\left(  1^{2}+2^{2}+\cdots+n^{2}\right)
}_{=\dfrac{n\left(  n+1\right)  \left(  2n+1\right)  }{6}}d^{2}
