This is symmetric in  $a_1$ ,  $b_1$ , and  $c_1$ , so this point also lies on  $BB_2$  and  $CC_2$ , so  $AA_2$ ,  $BB_2$ , and  $CC_2$  concur at this point, which lies on  $\omega$ .

