\[\angle BCF =\angle BAF=\angle BAC-\angle CAF= 60^{\circ} -\angle CAF =\angle FKC - \angle CAF =\angle ACK.\]
So,  $\triangle BCF \cong \triangle ACK$  which gives us that  $BF = AK$ . 

